[{"title":"公济惠山蔬四种并以佳篇来贶因次其韵 芹","author":"朱熹","text":"晚食宁论肉，知君薄世荣。\n琼田何日种，玉本一时生。\n白鹤今休误，青泥旧得名。\n收单还炙背，北阙傥关情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20801,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"公济惠山蔬四种并以佳篇来贶因次其韵 笋","author":"朱熹","text":"新笋因君寄，康庐入梦中。\n丹元馀故宅，翠竹尚馀风。\n日日来威凤，年年馔箨龙。\n犹嫌有兼味，不似一源功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20802,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"公济惠山蔬四种并以佳篇来贶因次其韵 蕨","author":"朱熹","text":"西山采蕨人，蓬首尚倾国。\n怀哉远莫致，引脰气已塞。\n倾筐忽堕前，此意岂易得。\n良遇不可迟，枯筇有馀力。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20803,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题吴公济风泉亭","author":"朱熹","text":"涧谷居永久，高情未云酬。\n兹焉发天秘，始造寒岩幽。\n上有茂树阴，下有清泉流。\n结亭倚苍峭，凿磴穷嵌丘。\n翠壁自屏立，青藓亦环周。\n朅来憩永夏，凛若临清秋。\n仰空韵笙竽，俯槛锵琳璆。\n幽听一以会，悠然与神谋。\n遐哉超世心，暇日聊娱忧。\n笑问车马客，谁能淹此留。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20804,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再题吴公济风泉亭","author":"朱熹","text":"华林翠涧响风泉，竟日闲来石上眠。\n更结危亭俯幽听，未妨长作地行仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20805,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉和公济兄留周宾之句","author":"朱熹","text":"端居感时序，驾言谁适从。\n聊携二三子，杖屦此日同。\n悠哉素心人，宴坐空岩中。\n真成三秋别，梦想情何穷。\n行行陟崇冈，引脰希高风。\n忽然两相值，俯仰迷西东。\n鳣堂偶休閒，鸡黍聊从容。\n不辞腰脚劳，共上西南峰。\n佩萸笑长房，把菊追陶公。\n遐观众山迥，一酌千虑融。\n兴罢复来归，杳霭秋堂空。\n窥樽讫馀沥，倚阁闻疏钟。\n主人意未阑，骊驹勿匆匆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20806,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄吴公济兼简李伯谏五首 其一","author":"朱熹","text":"客子归来春未深，祇应寒雨罢登临。\n闲窗竟日焚香坐，一段孤明见此心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20807,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄吴公济兼简李伯谏五首 其二","author":"朱熹","text":"三径莓苔昼掩关，君来问道却空还。\n从今蜡屐应无恙，有兴何妨再入山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20808,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄吴公济兼简李伯谏五首 其三","author":"朱熹","text":"盘翁别去久无书，可复因循自作疏。\n珍重寄声烦问讯，个中消息定何如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20809,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄吴公济兼简李伯谏五首 其四","author":"朱熹","text":"繁弦急管盛流传，清庙遗音久绝弦。\n欲识寥寥千古意，莫将新语勘尘编。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20810,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄吴公济兼简李伯谏五首 其五","author":"朱熹","text":"忆昔殊方久滞淫，年深归路始骎骎。\n傍人欲问箪瓢乐，理义谁知悦我心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20811,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"公济和诗见闵耽书勉以教外之乐以诗请问二首 其一","author":"朱熹","text":"至理无言绝浅深，尘尘刹刹不相侵。\n如云教外传真的，却是瞿昙有两心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20812,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"公济和诗见闵耽书勉以教外之乐以诗请问二首 其二","author":"朱熹","text":"未必瞿昙有两心，莫将此意搅儒林。\n欲知陋巷忧时乐，只向韦编绝处寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20813,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伯谏和诗云邪色哇声方漫漫是中正气愈骎骎予谓此乃圣人从心之妙三叹成诗重以问彼二首 其一","author":"朱熹","text":"任从耳畔妍声过，特地胸中顺气萌。\n个里讵容思勉得，羡君一跃了平生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20814,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伯谏和诗云邪色哇声方漫漫是中正气愈骎骎予谓此乃圣人从心之妙三叹成诗重以问彼二首 其二","author":"朱熹","text":"阙里当年语从心，至今踪迹尚难寻。\n况君直至无心处，肯向人前话浅深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20815,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游百丈山以徙倚弄云泉分韵赋诗得云字","author":"朱熹","text":"执热倦烦局，驾言起宵分。\n随川踏晓月，度岭披朝云。\n攀缘白石梯，拂拭苍藓纹。\n喷薄惊快觌，琮琤喜先闻。\n奇哉此精庐，眇然隔尘氛。\n诸公肯同来，定非俗子群。\n永日坐清樾，短章策奇勋。\n慨然念畴昔，联裾已荒坟。\n中路忘磬折，寸心谩丝棼。\n惟应泉石愿，三生有馀薰。\n兹游获重寻，十载心氤氲。\n他年访旧躅，山灵莫移文。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20816,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"百丈山六咏 其一 石磴","author":"朱熹","text":"层崖俯深幽，微径忽中断。\n努力一跻攀，前行有奇观。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20817,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"百丈山六咏 其二 小涧","author":"朱熹","text":"两崖交翠阴，一水自清泻。\n俯仰契幽情，神襟顿飘洒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20818,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"百丈山六咏 其三 山门","author":"朱熹","text":"置屋两山间，巧当奇绝处。\n峡束百泉倾，涧激回风度。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20819,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"百丈山六咏 其四 石台","author":"朱熹","text":"出谷转石棱，俯身窥木末。\n夕眺岚翠分，朝隮云海阔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20820,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"百丈山六咏 其五 西阁","author":"朱熹","text":"借此云窗眠，静夜心独苦。\n安得枕下泉，去作人间雨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20821,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"百丈山六咏 其六 瀑布","author":"朱熹","text":"巅崖出飞泉，百尺散风雨。\n空质丽晴晖，龙鸾共掀舞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20822,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游芦峰分韵得尽字","author":"朱熹","text":"芦山一何高，上上不可尽。\n我行独忘疲，泉石有招引。\n须臾出蒙密，矫首眺无畛。\n已谓极峥嵘，仰视犹隐嶙。\n新斋小休憩，馀力更勉黾。\n东峰切霄汉，首夏正凄紧。\n杖策同攀跻，极目散幽窘。\n万里俯连环，千里瞰孤隼。\n因知平生怀，未与尘虑泯。\n归涂采薇蕨，晚饷杂蔬笋。\n笑谓同来人，此愿天所允。\n独往会淹留，寒栖甘菌蠢。\n山阿子慕予，无忧勒回轸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20823,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同丘子服游芦峰以岭上多白云分韵赋诗得白字","author":"朱熹","text":"登岩出嚣尘，入谷媚泉石。\n悠然惬幽趣，不觉几朝夕。\n高寻倦冢顶，旧赏叹陈迹。\n仰惭仙人杖，俯愧谢公屐。\n昨日吾弟来，勇往意无斁。\n今晨蓐食罢，千仞一咫尺。\n心期未究竟，眼界已开辟。\n浮野众麓青，萦云两川白。\n须臾互吞吐，变化已今昔。\n旷若尘虑空，悲哉人境窄。\n平生有孤念，万里思矫翮。\n感此复冲然，胡为尚形役。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20824,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登芦峰","author":"朱熹","text":"行到芦峰最上头，几回振策又还休。\n因君好句撩孤兴，却恨云烟未肯收。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20825,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"将游云谷约同行者","author":"朱熹","text":"跻险择幽栖，搴萝结茅屋。\n疏泉下石濞，种树满烟谷。\n时登北原上，一骋千里目。\n云物下逶迤，冈峦远重复。\n暂辞忽旷岁，再往恨牵俗。\n因悲昨游侣，或已在鬼录。\n暄风悟新阳，一雨欣众绿。\n明发君莫迟，幽期我当卜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20826,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九月六日早发潭溪夜登云谷翌旦赋此","author":"朱熹","text":"怀山不能寐，中宵命行轩。\n亭午息畏景，薄暮登危峦。\n峻极踰百磴，萦纡欲千盘。\n行行遂曛黑，月落天风寒。\n羽人候中涂，良朋集林端。\n问我何所迫，而尝兹险艰。\n疲劳既云极，饥渴不能言。\n投装卧中丘，幸此一室宽。\n怒号竟永夕，客枕无时安。\n旦起辟幽户，竹树青檀栾。\n惊喜非昔睹，披寻得新观。\n淹留十日期，俯仰有馀欢。\n寄语后来子，勿辞行路难。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20827,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其一 云谷","author":"朱熹","text":"寒云无四时，散漫此山谷。\n幸乏霖雨姿，何妨媚幽独。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20828,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其二 南涧","author":"朱熹","text":"危石下峥嵘，高林上苍翠。\n中有横飞泉，崩奔杂奇丽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20829,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其三 瀑布","author":"朱熹","text":"峰回危径转，垂练忽千寻。\n不为登山倦，踌躇秋涧阴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20830,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其四 云关","author":"朱熹","text":"白云去复还，黄尘到难入。\n只有涧水声，出关流更急。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20831,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其五 莲沼","author":"朱熹","text":"亭亭玉芙蓉，迥立映澄碧。\n只愁山月明，照作寒露滴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20832,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其六 杉径","author":"朱熹","text":"南起云关口，萦纡上草堂。\n天风发清籁，山月度寒光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20833,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其七 云庄","author":"朱熹","text":"小丘横翠几，层嶂复嵯峨。\n释耒闲来看，岩姿此处多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20834,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其八 泉硖","author":"朱熹","text":"入关但平田，复此得清响。\n何必问真源，神襟一萧爽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20835,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其九 石池","author":"朱熹","text":"两岸苍峭石，护此碧泓寒。\n秋月来窥影，骊珠吐玉盘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20836,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其十 山楹","author":"朱熹","text":"山楹一怅望，恨此云迷谷。\n仙人不可期，缥缈双髻绿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20837,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其十一 药圃","author":"朱熹","text":"长镵斸灵根，莳此泉下圃。\n珍剂未须论，丹荑已堪煮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20838,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其十二 井泉","author":"朱熹","text":"山高泽气通，石窦飞灵液。\n默料谷中云，多应从此出。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20839,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其十三 西寮","author":"朱熹","text":"畬田种胡麻，结草寄林樾。\n珍重无心人，寒栖弄明月。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20840,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其十四 晦庵","author":"朱熹","text":"忆昔屏山翁，示我一言教。\n自信久未能，岩栖冀微效。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20841,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其十五 草庐","author":"朱熹","text":"青山绕蓬庐，白云障幽户。\n卒岁聊自娱，时人莫留顾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20842,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其十六 怀仙","author":"朱熹","text":"西望多奇峰，北瞰独仙府。\n欲致武夷君，石坛罗桂醑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20843,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其十七 挥手","author":"朱熹","text":"山台一挥手，从此断将迎。\n不见尘中事，惟闻打麦声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20844,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其十八 云社","author":"朱熹","text":"自作山中人，即与云为友。\n一啸雨纷纷，无劳三奠酒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20845,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其十九 桃蹊","author":"朱熹","text":"涧里春泉响，种桃泉上头。\n烂红纷委地，未肯出山流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20846,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其二十 竹坞","author":"朱熹","text":"悄茜桃蹊北，萧椮竹坞深。\n不堪秋夜永，风雨助悲吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20847,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其二十一 漆园","author":"朱熹","text":"旧闻南华仙，作吏漆园里。\n应悟见割忧，嗒然空隐几。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20848,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其二十二 茶坂","author":"朱熹","text":"携籯北岭西，采撷供茗饮。\n一啜夜窗寒，跏趺谢衾枕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20849,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其二十三 绝顶","author":"朱熹","text":"当年赫曦台，移治在兹岭。\n寥廓无四邻，三光疑倒影。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20850,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其二十四 北涧","author":"朱熹","text":"土断川亦分，北下成阴涧。\n秀石得佳名，服膺吾敢慢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20851,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其二十五 中溪","author":"朱熹","text":"南下东岭阿，云是中溪道。\n岩树爱樛枝，石田悲蔓草。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20852,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷二十六咏 其二十六 休庵","author":"朱熹","text":"别岭有精庐，林峦亦幽绝。\n无事一往来，茶瓜不须设。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20853,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷杂诗十二首 其一 登山","author":"朱熹","text":"夕阳翳东峰，微月下西岭。\n不辞青鞋穿，陟此岩路永。\n岩路永且跻，中情何耿耿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20854,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷杂诗十二首 其二 值风","author":"朱熹","text":"山下风吹衣，山上风拔木。\n茅茨何足保，瀛海虑翻覆。\n永念执鬯人，无心还自恧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20855,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷杂诗十二首 其三 玩月","author":"朱熹","text":"风起云气昏，风定天宇肃。\n遥遥万里晖，炯炯穿我屋。\n良友共徘徊，山中讵幽独。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20856,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷杂诗十二首 其四 谢客","author":"朱熹","text":"野人载酒来，农谈日西夕。\n此意良已勤，感叹情何极。\n归去莫频来，林深山路黑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20857,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷杂诗十二首 其五 劳农","author":"朱熹","text":"四体久不勤，筋力坐驽缓。\n何事两山阿，离离豆苗满。\n多谢植杖翁，居然见长短。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20858,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷杂诗十二首 其六 讲道","author":"朱熹","text":"高居远尘杂，崇论探杳冥。\n亹亹玄运驶，林林群动争。\n天道固如此，吾生安得宁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20859,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷杂诗十二首 其七 怀人","author":"朱熹","text":"吾党二三子，欲来从我游。\n尘机谅扰扰，遐诺终悠悠。\n空山日复晚，伫立怅夷犹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20860,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷杂诗十二首 其八 倦游","author":"朱熹","text":"故人千里别，约我仍丹丘。\n云何一解散，书到令人愁。\n此山岂不幽，何必赋远游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20861,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷杂诗十二首 其九 修书","author":"朱熹","text":"紬书厌尘累，执简投云关。\n灵钥启玄秘，萧斧锄幽奸。\n书成莫示人，留置此山间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20862,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷杂诗十二首 其十 宴坐","author":"朱熹","text":"登山思无穷，临水心未厌。\n沉痾何当平，膏肓今自砭。\n默坐秋堂空，遐观靡馀念。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20863,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷杂诗十二首 其十一 下山","author":"朱熹","text":"行随流水声，步出哀壑底。\n绿树枝相樛，白涧石齿齿。\n树石无穷年，流水日千里。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20864,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷杂诗十二首 其十二 还家","author":"朱熹","text":"出去柴门掩，归来蕙草秋。\n素荂林下吐，清芬衣上浮。\n欲寄山中友，日暮怅离忧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20865,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷合记事目效俳体戏作三诗寄季通 其一","author":"朱熹","text":"云关须早筑，基趾要坚牢。\n栽竹行教密，穿池岸欲高。\n乘春移菡萏，带雪觅萧椮。\n更向关门外，疏泉斩乱蒿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20866,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷合记事目效俳体戏作三诗寄季通 其二","author":"朱熹","text":"堂成今六载，上雨复旁风。\n逐急添茅盖，连忙毕土功。\n桂林何日秀，兰径几时通。\n并筑双台子，东山接水筒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20867,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷合记事目效俳体戏作三诗寄季通 其三","author":"朱熹","text":"庄舍宜先立，山楹却渐营。\n泉疏药圃润，堰起石池清。\n早印荒田契，仍标别户名。\n想应频检校，祇恐欠方兄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20868,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云谷怀魏元履","author":"朱熹","text":"叹息艮斋老，当年共此来。\n千峰奇绝处，一望兴悠哉。\n病怯披云卧，诗劳拥鼻裁。\n祇今何处所，宿草閟馀哀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20869,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿云际寺许顺之将别以诗求教次韵","author":"朱熹","text":"薄暮投花县，联车入翠微。\n长林生缺月，永夜照寒扉。\n情话欣无斁，离怀怅有违。\n勉哉彊毅力，千里要同归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20870,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽汪端明三首 其一","author":"朱熹","text":"圣王兴炎运，明公起妙年。\n材推汉庭右，学自北方传。\n出入丹心壮，安危素发鲜。\n空馀题剑在，光烛旧林泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":20871,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]